                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Company seniority shall be computed by the applicable definition. Notwithstanding the foregoing provisions of this paragraph 1), Company seniority of the employees in the Building Maintenance Section of the Real Estate Department shall be subject to the provisions of the letter dated November 8, 1962 from the Company to the Union.",
