        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) Departmental Seniority – Department seniority is defined as an employee's length of service, within the bargaining unit in a particular department, unbroken by an event specified in paragraph 4) hereof. Departmental seniority shall be separately computed for the following departments: Distribution, Customer Service (see Customer Service section of contract), Meter Reading, Metering, Property Operations and Maintenance. Property Maintenance Operations, Field Service Operations, Stock and Transportation Departments.",
